The token embeddings were initialized from BAAI/bge-m3 (MIT) and trained on
minishlab/tokenlearn-c4-multilingual-bge-m3, derived from multilingual C4, and
on public retrieval pairs from hotchpotch/bekko-embedding-v1-unsupervised.

tokenizer.json and config.json are the upstream files. model.safetensors is the
upstream float32 table stored as int8 with one float32 scale per row, derived
by Loupist's stage-embed-assets.py. Weights are loaded from these files only;
search does not download models.
